"step), ``DIPOLE.dat`` (dipole moment at each step), ``info.dat`` (energy "
"and temperature at each step), ``rsdft.json``, and ``rsdft.atom``. The "
"folders for the static calculations contain ``rsdft.json`` (total energy)"
" and ``rsdft.atom``."

