#: ../../co2_ir/reproduction.rst:161
msgid ""
"``co2_static_standard.zip`` "
"の13個の構造をそれぞれMaterialとして登録し、計算機能「自己無撞着電子状態計算（SCF）」のJobを作って実行します。\\ "
"数値誤差を確かめる場合は、 ``co2_static_small.zip`` （13個）と ``co2_static_shift.zip`` "
"（9個）についても同じ計算を行います。"
msgstr ""
"Register each of the 13 structures in ``co2_static_standard.zip`` as a "
"Material, then create and run a \"Single-Point SCF\" Job for each one. \\"
" To check numerical error, run the same calculations for "
"``co2_static_small.zip`` (13 structures) and ``co2_static_shift.zip`` (9 "
"structures)."

#: ../../co2_ir/reproduction.rst:164
msgid "解析スクリプトは、各Jobの全エネルギーを2次・4次の多項式でフィットして、調和振動数を求めます。"
msgstr ""
"The analysis script fits quadratic and fourth-order polynomials to the "
"total energies from the Jobs to obtain harmonic frequencies."

#: ../../co2_ir/reproduction.rst:166
msgid ""
"4次フィット： :math:`|u|\\le 0.06` bohrの全点を :math:`E = ku^2/2 + c_3u^3 + "
"c_4u^4` でフィットします。"
msgstr ""
"The fourth-order fit uses all points with :math:`|u|\\le 0.06` bohr and "
"the expression :math:`E = ku^2/2 + c_3u^3 + c_4u^4`."

#: ../../co2_ir/reproduction.rst:167
msgid "2次フィット： :math:`|u|\\le 0.02` bohrの点だけを :math:`E = ku^2/2` でフィットします。"
msgstr ""
"The quadratic fit uses only points with :math:`|u|\\le 0.02` bohr and the"
" expression :math:`E = ku^2/2`."

#: ../../co2_ir/reproduction.rst:169
msgid "調和振動数は、得られた曲率 :math:`k` と各モードの有効質量から求めます。"
msgstr ""
"The harmonic frequencies follow from the fitted curvature :math:`k` and "
"the effective mass of each mode."

