msgstr ""
"Write the dipole moment to ``DIPOLE.dat`` at each step (the line you "
"added)"

#: ../../co2_ir/reproduction.rst:234
msgid ""
"NVEでは、熱浴のキーワード（ ``MDNHC`` など）は書き込まれません。\\ "
"BOMDでは、各ステップで前のステップの波動関数を初期値にしてSCFを収束させます（反復の上限は「SCF 最大反復回数」）。\\ "
"``MDDIPOLE`` を指定したMDの終了後、RSDFTは双極子のスペクトルを ``dfxi.json`` 、 ``dfyi.json`` 、"
" ``dfzi.json`` と、そのKramers–Kronig変換 ``dfxr.json`` などにも出力します。"
msgstr ""
"For NVE, the input file contains no heat bath keywords (such as "
"``MDNHC``). \\ At each BOMD step, the wavefunctions from the preceding "
"step provide the starting point for converging the SCF calculation (\"Max"
" SCF Iterations\" sets the iteration limit). \\ ``MDDIPOLE`` also tells "
"RSDFT to write the dipole spectra to ``dfxi.json``, ``dfyi.json``, and "
"``dfzi.json`` and their Kramers–Kronig transforms to files such as "
"``dfxr.json`` after the MD run ends."

#: ../../co2_ir/reproduction.rst:239
msgid "4. 出力のダウンロードと解析"
msgstr "4. Downloading and Analyzing the Output"

#: ../../co2_ir/reproduction.rst:241
msgid ""
"各Jobの詳細画面の「ファイル」で「出力ファイル」に切り替え、「一括ダウンロード」でZIPを取得します。\\ "
"ダウンロードしたZIPを1つのフォルダ（例えば ``downloads`` ）に集め、そのフォルダを指定して解析スクリプトを実行します。"
msgstr ""
"On each Job details screen, open \"Files\", switch to \"Output Files\", "
"and use \"Batch Download\" to get the ZIP archive. \\ Collect the "
"downloaded ZIP files in a single folder (for example, ``downloads``) and "
"run the analysis script with that folder as its argument."

#: ../../co2_ir/reproduction.rst:244
msgid "python analyze_co2_ir.py downloads"
msgstr "python analyze_co2_ir.py downloads"

#: ../../co2_ir/reproduction.rst:248
msgid "スクリプトは、フォルダの中のZIPを1つずつ開き、出力ファイルの内容から計算の種類を判定します。"
msgstr ""
"The script opens each ZIP file in the folder and uses its contents to "
"identify the type of calculation."

#: ../../co2_ir/reproduction.rst:250
msgid ""
"``TRAJECTORY.cif`` 、 ``info.dat`` 、 ``DIPOLE.dat`` があればMDです。 ``info.dat``"
" の列数からCPMDかBOMDかを、 ``TRAJECTORY.cif`` の最初のフレームのC–O結合長から開始構造を判定します。 "
"``DIPOLE.dat`` がない場合は、 ``MDDIPOLE`` の追記を忘れたものとして読み飛ばします。"
msgstr ""
"If ``TRAJECTORY.cif``, ``info.dat``, and ``DIPOLE.dat`` are present, the "
"calculation is an MD run. The script distinguishes CPMD from BOMD by the "
"number of columns in ``info.dat`` and identifies the starting structure "
"from the C–O bond length in the first frame of ``TRAJECTORY.cif``. If "
"``DIPOLE.dat`` is missing, the script assumes ``MDDIPOLE`` was omitted "
"and skips the run."

#: ../../co2_ir/reproduction.rst:251
msgid ""
"それ以外は静的計算です。 ``rsdft.atom`` の原子配置を基準構造と比べて、モードと変位を判定し、 ``rsdft.json`` "
"から全エネルギーを読みます。"
msgstr ""
"Otherwise, it treats the output as a static calculation. The script "
"compares the atomic positions in ``rsdft.atom`` with the reference "
"structure to identify the mode and displacement, then reads the total "
"energy from ``rsdft.json``."

#: ../../co2_ir/reproduction.rst:253
msgid ""
"ZIPの名前は判定に使わないので、ダウンロードしたままの名前で構いません。\\ 展開したフォルダを指定することもできます。\\ "
"判定の結果を最初に表示し、続いて記事中の数値を表示して、図を ``figures`` フォルダに書き出します（ ``--figures`` "
"で変更できます）。\\ 一部の計算だけを行った場合は、そのJobから求められる数値と図だけを出力します。"
msgstr ""
"The script identifies the calculation without using the ZIP file names, "
"so you can keep the names as downloaded. \\ You can also specify a folder"
" containing extracted files. \\ The script first reports which "
"calculations it found, then prints the numbers in the article and writes "
"the figures to the ``figures`` folder. The ``--figures`` option changes "
"the output folder. \\ If you ran only some of the calculations, the "
"script outputs only the numbers and figures it can generate from those "
"Jobs."

#: ../../co2_ir/reproduction.rst:258
msgid "記事の数値と図は、上の「記事の計算の出力」のZIPを1つのフォルダに集めて、同じように実行すると得られます。"
msgstr ""
"You can obtain the numbers and figures in the article by collecting the "
"ZIP files from \"Output from the Calculations in This Article\" above in "
"one folder and running the script the same way."

#: ../../co2_ir/reproduction.rst:260
msgid "python analyze_co2_ir.py data"
msgstr "python analyze_co2_ir.py data"

#: ../../co2_ir/reproduction.rst:264
msgid ""
"出力の ``rsdft.atom`` は、RSDFTが分率座標を小数6桁で書き直したもので、MDでは最後のステップの構造になっています。\\ "
"そのため、スクリプトはMDの開始構造を ``TRAJECTORY.cif`` の最初のフレームから読みます。\\ "
"静的計算の変位は、構造ファイルを0.0001 bohr単位で作ってあるので、 ``rsdft.atom`` "
"から読んだ値をその単位に丸めて使います。"
msgstr ""
"In the output file ``rsdft.atom``, RSDFT writes the fractional "
"coordinates to six decimal places. For MD, the file contains the "
"structure at the final step. \\ The script therefore reads the MD "
"starting structure from the first frame of ``TRAJECTORY.cif``. \\ For the"
" static calculations, the structure files use increments of 0.0001 bohr "
"for the displacements, so the script rounds the displacements read from "
"``rsdft.atom`` to that increment."

#: ../../co2_ir/reproduction.rst:269
msgid "計算と数値を扱う上での注意"
msgstr "Notes on Calculations and Numerical Results"

#: ../../co2_ir/reproduction.rst:271
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**時間刻み。** 電子の仮想質量400 a.u.と時間刻み0.1 fsの組み合わせでは、電子の仮想運動エネルギーが急に増え、約3 "
"fsで計算が発散しました。0.05 fsでは安定で、保存量の初期値からのずれは、最適化構造から始めた計算で最大 "
":math:`5.8\\times10^{-6}` Ha、1.150 Åから始めた計算で最大 :math:`1.3\\times10^{-5}` "
"Haでした。"
msgstr ""
"**Time step.** With a fictitious electron mass of 400 a.u. and a time "
"step of 0.1 fs, the fictitious electronic kinetic energy rose sharply and"
" the calculation diverged after about 3 fs. At 0.05 fs it was stable. The"
" largest deviations of the conserved quantity from its initial value were"
" :math:`5.8\\times10^{-6}` Ha for the run starting from the optimized "
"structure and :math:`1.3\\times10^{-5}` Ha for the run starting at 1.150 "
"Å."

#: ../../co2_ir/reproduction.rst:272
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**BOMDのSCFと保存量。** "
"BOMDでは、すべてのステップでSCFが収束しました（1ステップあたり約18回の反復）。保存量の初期値からのずれは、最適化構造から始めた計算で最大"
" :math:`5.3\\times10^{-6}` Ha、1.150 Åから始めた計算で最大 :math:`5.4\\times10^{-6}`"
" Haでした。"
msgstr ""
"**SCF convergence and the conserved quantity in BOMD.** The SCF "
"calculation converged at every BOMD step (about 18 iterations per step). "
"The largest deviations of the conserved quantity from its initial value "
"were :math:`5.3\\times10^{-6}` Ha for the run starting from the optimized"
" structure and :math:`5.4\\times10^{-6}` Ha for the run starting at 1.150"
" Å."

#: ../../co2_ir/reproduction.rst:273
msgid ""
"**初速度。** "
"RSDFTは、乱数の種を固定した擬似乱数で初速度を与えます。そのため4つのMDの初速度は同じで、MPIの並列数を変えても変わりませんでした。重心の運動は取り除かれますが、角運動量は取り除かれません。"
msgstr ""
"**Initial velocities.** RSDFT assigns the initial velocities using "
"pseudorandom numbers with a fixed seed. The 4 MD runs therefore had the "
"same initial velocities, which stayed the same when we changed the number"
" of MPI processes. RSDFT removes the center-of-mass motion but leaves the"
" angular momentum in place."

#: ../../co2_ir/reproduction.rst:274
msgid ""
"**並列数。** "
"RSDFTは実空間格子を空間的に分割してMPIのプロセスに割り当てます。担当領域に原子の非局所擬ポテンシャルが1つも含まれないプロセスがあると、「Error:"
" Too many "
"threads」というエラーで止まります（OpenMPのスレッド数が1でも起こります）。大きなセルの中央に分子を1個置いた今回の計算では、どの領域もセルの中心に接する分割（4並列の2×2×1、8並列の2×2×2）だけが使え、3並列、16並列、32並列は実行できませんでした。Quloudでは選んだvCPUの数だけMPIのプロセスを使うので、4"
" vCPUか8 vCPUを選びます。"
msgstr ""
"**Number of MPI processes.** RSDFT divides the real-space grid into "
"spatial regions and assigns them to MPI processes. If any process has a "
"region containing no nonlocal pseudopotential from any atom, the "
"calculation stops with \"Error: Too many threads\" (even with just 1 "
"OpenMP thread). For this calculation with one molecule at the center of a"
" large cell, only partitions in which every region touches the cell "
"center worked (2×2×1 with 4 processes and 2×2×2 with 8 processes). The "
"runs with 3, 16, and 32 processes failed. Quloud uses one MPI process per"
" selected vCPU, so select 4 vCPU or 8 vCPU."

#: ../../co2_ir/reproduction.rst:275
msgid ""
"**スペクトルの計算。** "
"記事のパワースペクトルは、双極子から計算全体の平均値を引き、自己相関関数（偏りのある推定量）にHann窓の半分を掛けて余弦変換したものです。ピークの位置は、ゼロ埋めで細かくした波数の格子上の最大値で、分解能（約42"
" cm⁻¹）より細かい桁に意味はありません。RSDFTが出力する ``dfzi.json`` などは、 ``analyze_co2_ir.py``"
" の ``rsdft_style`` と同じ処理で、ピークの位置と高さが一致することを確認しました。"
msgstr ""
"**Spectrum calculation.** To obtain the power spectra in the article, we "
"subtracted the full-run mean from the dipole moment, multiplied the "
"autocorrelation function (a biased estimator) by half of a Hann window, "
"and took the cosine transform. Peak positions are the maxima on a "
"wavenumber grid refined by zero padding. Digits finer than the resolution"
" (about 42 cm⁻¹) have no significance. RSDFT generates outputs such as "
"``dfzi.json`` with the same procedure as ``rsdft_style`` in "
"``analyze_co2_ir.py``. We verified that the peak positions and heights "
"agree."

#: ../../co2_ir/reproduction.rst:276
msgid ""
"**双極子の計算方法。** RSDFTは、計算の初めに原子の重心をセルの中心に移したと仮定し、すべての原子がセルの各面から5.6 "
"bohrより離れている場合だけ、電子密度から双極子を求める式（ :doc:`ir_spectrum` "
"の計算条件の節）を使います。この条件を満たさない場合は、原子の電荷（Bader電荷）を固定した点電荷の近似に切り替わり、MD中の電子密度の変化は双極子に反映されません。今回のセルでは、面に最も近い酸素原子でも4.1"
" Å（7.8 bohr）離れているので、条件を満たしています。"
msgstr ""
"**Dipole calculation.** RSDFT assumes that the atomic center of mass was "
"shifted to the cell center at the start of the calculation. It uses the "
"equation for the dipole moment from the electron density (see the section"
" \"Systems and Calculation Conditions\" in :doc:`ir_spectrum`) only if "
"every atom is more than 5.6 bohr from each face of the cell. If this "
"condition fails, RSDFT switches to a point-charge approximation with "
"fixed atomic charges (Bader charges), so changes in the electron density "
"during MD do not appear in the dipole moment. This cell meets the "
"condition because even the oxygen atom nearest a face is 4.1 Å (7.8 bohr)"
" away."

#: ../../co2_ir/reproduction.rst:277
msgid ""
"**原子の座標の精度。** ``TRAJECTORY.cif`` の分率座標は小数6桁（セルの1辺10.6 Åに対して約10⁻⁵ "
"Å）です。記事の計算で ``ALLTRAJ 1`` "
"により別に出力した、より桁数の多い座標と比べても、ピークの位置と吸収強度は表示した桁まで一致しました。"
msgstr ""
"**Precision of the atomic coordinates.** The fractional coordinates in "
"``TRAJECTORY.cif`` have six decimal places (about 10⁻⁵ Å for the 10.6 Å "
"cell). The peak positions and absorption intensities agreed to the digits"
" shown when we compared them with results from the higher-precision "
"coordinates written separately using ``ALLTRAJ 1``."

#: ../../co2_ir/reproduction.rst:278
msgid ""
"**双極子の変化率。** 質量で重みをつけた基準座標は、 :math:`z` "
"軸に沿った直線分子を仮定して原子の変位から求めています。分子軸が傾くとこの仮定が崩れるので、回帰には分子軸の傾きが小さい最初の400 "
"fsだけを使いました。"
msgstr ""
"**Dipole derivative.** We obtain the mass-weighted normal coordinates "
"from the atomic displacements, assuming a linear molecule aligned with "
"the :math:`z` axis. This assumption breaks down if the molecular axis "
"tilts, so for the regression we used only the first 400 fs, when the tilt"
" was small."

